          <div class="overview-banner"><div class="banner-symbol"><Scale :size="40" stroke-width="1.4"/></div><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR PRACTICE, CONNECTED.</span><h2>案件有序，协作有方。</h2><p>从利益冲突到结案归档，让每一个重要环节紧密相连。</p></div><div class="banner-stats"><strong>{{ dashboard.stats.pending||0 }}<small>项待审批</small></strong><span></span><strong>{{ dashboard.stats.overdue||0 }}<small>项逾期待办</small></strong></div><button class="banner-link" @click="navigate('cases')">进入案件中心<ArrowUpRight :size="17"/></button></div>
          <div class="stats-grid"><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>全部案件</span><div class="icon-tile lavender"><BriefcaseBusiness :size="20"/></div></div><strong>{{ dashboard.stats.total||0 }}<small>件</small></strong><div class="stat-foot"><span class="text-purple">{{ dashboard.stats.intake||0 }} 件</span>正在立案流程中</div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>办理中案件</span><div class="icon-tile blue"><Activity :size="20"/></div></div><strong>{{ dashboard.stats.active||0 }}<small>件</small></strong><div class="stat-foot">已结案及归档 <span class="text-green">{{ dashboard.stats.closed||0 }} 件</span></div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>已确认到账 · CNY</span><div class="icon-tile green"><CircleDollarSign :size="20"/></div></div><strong class="stat-money">{{ currency(fund.received) }}</strong><div class="stat-foot">已开票 <span>{{ currency(fund.invoiced) }}</span></div></div><div class="stat-card"><div class="stat-top"><span>待审批事项</span><div class="icon-tile amber"><ClipboardCheck :size="20"/></div></div><strong>{{ dashboard.stats.pending||0 }}<small>项</small></strong><div class="stat-foot"><span class="amber-dot"></span>利冲、立案与业务审批</div></div></div>
