          <div class="dashboard-columns"><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>待我关注<span class="counter">{{ dashboard.stats.pending||0 }}</span></h2><button class="text-button" @click="navigate('conflicts')">查看利冲<ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div><div class="attention-list"><button v-for="item in dashboard.pending.slice(0,4)" :key="item.id" class="attention-row" @click="navigateCase(item.kind==='cases'?item.id:item.case_id,item.kind==='conflicts'||item.kind==='cases'?'intake':item.kind==='invoices'?'finance':item.kind)"><span class="icon-tile small" :class="item.kind==='conflicts'?'amber':'lavender'"><ShieldCheck v-if="item.kind==='conflicts'" :size="18"/><FileCheck2 v-else :size="18"/></span><div><strong>{{ item.title }}</strong><small>{{ schemas[item.kind]?.label }}审批<span class="dot-separator">·</span>{{ dateText(item.updated_at) }}</small></div><StatusBadge :status="item.status" :label="stateLabel(item.kind,item.status)"/><ChevronRight :size="16"/></button><div v-if="!dashboard.pending.length" class="compact-empty"><CheckCircle2 :size="30"/><p>暂时没有待审批事项</p></div></div></section><section class="panel"><div class="panel-heading"><h2>近期日程</h2><button class="text-button" @click="navigate('tasks')">全部日程<ArrowRight :size="14"/></button></div><div class="schedule-list"><button v-for="task in dashboard.tasks.slice(0,3)" :key="task.id" class="schedule-item" @click="navigateCase(task.case_id,'tasks')"><div class="date-block"><strong>{{ task.due_on?.slice(8,10)||'—' }}</strong><small>{{ task.due_on?.slice(5,7) }}月</small></div><div><span class="task-type">{{ task.type }}</span><strong>{{ task.title }}</strong><small>{{ lawyerName(task.assignee_id) }}<span class="dot-separator">·</span>{{ task.priority }}</small></div><span class="priority-dot" :class="{urgent:task.priority==='紧急'}"></span></button><div v-if="!dashboard.tasks.length" class="compact-empty"><CalendarDays :size="30"/><p>暂无待完成日程</p></div></div></section></div>
